    {
      "source": "For indexed collections, such as <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a>, <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Queue.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Queue</code></a> or <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Deque.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Deque</code></a> consider\n<a href=\"RedisList.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.support.collections\"><code>RedisList</code></a>.",
      "translation": "对于索引集合，例如 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a>、<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Queue.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Queue</code></a> 或 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Deque.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Deque</code></a>，请考虑\n<a href=\"RedisList.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.support.collections\"><code>RedisList</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "For collections without duplicates the obvious candidate is\n<a href=\"RedisSet.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.support.collections\"><code>RedisSet</code></a>. Use\n<a href=\"RedisZSet.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.support.collections\"><code>RedisZSet</code></a> if a certain order is required.",
      "translation": "对于无重复元素的集合，显而易见的候选者是 <a href=\"RedisSet.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.support.collections 中的接口\"><code>RedisSet</code></a>。如果需要特定的顺序，请使用 <a href=\"RedisZSet.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.support.collections 中的接口\"><code>RedisZSet</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
